      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDi3MiykAgM",
      "content": "Hey Chris I was looking to get an estimate online on your website but my my case is a little unusual so it recommended to call you guys instead I have new furniture. Yeah go ahead. You were about to pay something.",
      "name": "Raza Shah",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:13:12.927659",
