    {
      "content": "question",
      "name": "Chris Beattie",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:13:32.723237",
      "type": "moment",
      "user_id": "6165469371629568"
    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDi3MiykAgM",
      "content": "So the move isn't really a move. We're just getting some new furniture delivered this Sunday and I have an injury that doesn't allow me to lift, wait until I get that sorted. So we're looking for help for people to come in and move some still that around take them from the ground floor to the first floor, or the first story to the second story and just help us rearrange some furniture so that we can MakeSpace for the new furniture that, that's coming in that literally what we're looking for.",
      "name": "Raza Shah",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:13:35.127659",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Mm-hmm.",
      "name": "Chris Beattie",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:13:49.658237",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "6165469371629568"
    },
    {
      "content": "Mm-hmm.",
      "name": "Chris Beattie",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:13:59.858237",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "6165469371629568"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh.",
      "name": "Chris Beattie",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:14:08.258237",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "6165469371629568"
    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDi3MiykAgM",
      "content": "Do you guys do that?",
      "name": "Raza Shah",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:14:10.527659",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDi3MiykAgM",
      "content": "question",
      "name": "Raza Shah",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:14:10.527659",
      "type": "moment"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay, so basically just a credit.",
      "name": "Chris Beattie",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:14:10.658237",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "6165469371629568"
    },
    {
      "content": "Yeah, we definitely do. We charge an hourly. We have a two and a half hour minimum. So are, are you talking about just moving stuff on site around inside the home? Yeah.",
      "name": "Chris Beattie",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:14:14.258237",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "6165469371629568"
    },
    {
      "content": "ai_scorecard_llm_v2",
      "name": "Chris Beattie",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:14:14.258237",
      "type": "moment",
      "user_id": "6165469371629568"
    },
    {
      "content": "ai_scorecard_llm_v2",
      "name": "Chris Beattie",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:14:14.258237",
      "type": "moment",
      "user_id": "6165469371629568"
    },
    {
      "content": "question",
      "name": "Chris Beattie",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:14:19.643237",
      "type": "moment",
      "user_id": "6165469371629568"
    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDi3MiykAgM",
      "content": "Yeah. Yup, yeah, it's literally a, a bunch of stuff that we need to move from the ground floor to the first floor and then just put the new sofa in the right prices on the, on the ground floor.",
      "name": "Raza Shah",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:14:22.527659",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay, I gotcha. Yeah, we can definitely do that. We charge hourly so for Sunday it's a different, different rates a little bit depending on the day of week on Sunday the hourly for two man team is to, to an hour, it's $101 per hour per mover. We'd send it to main team for something like that so it'd be $202 an hour and then we have that two and a half hour minimum. So anything two and a half hours or less you pay for the two and a half hours which would just be the $202 times 2.5, which will be $505. So that'd be, that would, if it takes a two and a half hours or less you'd be spinning that exactly, there'll be no additional fees or anything else extra, everything is included in the hourly rate.",
      "name": "Chris Beattie",
      "time": "2026-09-18T17:14:39.458237",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "6165469371629568"
    },
